  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d779d4715048234dbbf2415be188cb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: MurderedMan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: MurderedMan
  Prompt: You come across a slain man with a sword embedded in his back. Hunched
    over him, a small boy digs through his belongings. He turns sharply as you approach,
    and you see that he's not half large enough to wield the blade. "He's mine! I
    found him first!" shouts the boy. He grips the man's bag, still struggling to
    pull it from his body.
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 2
  Choices:
  - Text: '"I''ll pay you."'
    SuccessChance: 0.82
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: As you extend a palm full of gold, the boy eagerly grabs at the coins.
        He dissappears off into the woods before you have the chance to ask any questions.
        Examining the bag, you find that your gamble paid off.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 1
        _moneyDelta: -22
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
      - Type: 9
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: The boy is quick to take your money, and vanishes without a trace. Upon
        closer inspection, you find that the bag is empty. Whoever killed the man
        must have looted his corpse.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 1
        _moneyDelta: -22
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
  - Text: Leave the boy alone.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
